.TH PEEKABOO 1 "2026-11-24" "peekaboo 1.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
peekaboo \- infrared face unlock for laptops
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B peekaboo
[\fB\-\-user\fR \fINAME\fR] \fICOMMAND\fR [\fIARGS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Unlocks the lock screen, the login screen, sudo and system prompts by looking at
you, on laptops with an infrared (Windows Hello) camera. The work is done by the
.BR peekaboo.service ;
this command talks to it.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B gui
Open the app.
.TP
.B status
Enrolled faces, settings and state.
.TP
\fBenroll\fR [\fB\-\-ir\-only\fR] [\fB\-\-camera\fR \fIID\fR] [\fINAME\fR]
Register a face. Both cameras watch and have to agree; only infrared is stored.
.TP
\fBtest\fR [\fB\-\-gesture\fR]
Try recognition and show scores. Grants nothing.
.TP
\fBremove\fR \fIID\fR | \fB\-\-all\fR
Remove a face.
.TP
\fBuse\fR [\fBlock\fR] [\fBlogin\fR] [\fBshell\fR] [\fBsystem\fR] | \fBall\fR | \fBnone\fR
Use Peekaboo only for these. Without arguments, show the choice.
.TP
\fBset head\-turn\fR \fIUSE\fR... | \fBall\fR | \fBnone\fR
Where to ask for a small turn of the head.
.TP
\fBset attention on\fR | \fBoff\fR
Whether the eyes must be open and the face turned to the camera.
.TP
\fBset level standard\fR | \fBhigh\fR | \fBmaximum\fR
How strictly to match.
.TP
\fBcameras\fR [\fB\-\-probe\fR]
List cameras and how they were recognised; with \-\-probe, look through them.
.TP
\fBhistory\fR [\fB\-\-clear\fR]
Recent unlocks.
.TP
\fBanimation\fR [\fBon\fR | \fBoff\fR | \fBstudio\fR]
The GNOME animation.
.TP
.B doctor
Check hardware and installation.
.TP
.B logs
The service log.
.PP
Loosening a setting asks for the password, tightening one does not.
.SH TERMINALS
While the camera looks, the password can be typed as usual; it is tried as soon as
Enter is pressed. Enter alone goes to the password prompt, Ctrl+C aborts.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/peekaboo/config.toml
Configuration. Its comments describe every option.
.TP
.I /var/lib/peekaboo
Encrypted faces, settings and history.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR pam (7),
.BR pam\-auth\-update (8),
.UR https://github.com/Hesam\-deb/peekaboo
.UE
